{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23242","headline":"对酒自勉 · 白居易","name":"对酒自勉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五十江城守，停杯一自思。\n头仍未尽白，官亦不全卑。\n荣宠寻过分，欢娱已校迟。\n肺伤虽怕酒，心健尚夸诗。\n夜舞吴娘袖，春歌蛮子词。\n犹堪三五岁，相伴醉花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}